      "filename": "A Plan of Lower Fort Garry (1928) (2196086650).jpg",
      "title": "File:A Plan of Lower Fort Garry (1928) (2196086650).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/A_Plan_of_Lower_Fort_Garry_%281928%29_%282196086650%29.jpg",
